{
  "id": "33992_kanzuku",
  "headword": "{感|かん}づく",
  "reading": "かんづく",
  "romaji": "kanzuku",
  "part_of_speech": "verb (godan)",
  "gloss": "to sense; to get wind of; to suspect",
  "definitions": [
    {
      "sense_number": 1,
      "gloss": "to sense; to get wind of; to catch on",
      "explanation": "To notice or suspect something that is being hidden, from small signs rather than being told: a secret, a plan, someone's true feelings."
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "id": "33992_kanzuku_ex1",
      "japanese": "⟦{母|はは}→母：00549_haha⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{感|かん}づかれた。",
      "english": "My mother caught on.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "33992_kanzuku_ex2",
      "japanese": "⟦{彼|かれ}→彼：01292_kare⟧⟦は→は：00079_ha⟧⟦{何|なに}か→何か：03873_nanika⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{感|かん}づいたようだ。",
      "english": "He seems to have sensed something.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "33992_kanzuku_ex3",
      "japanese": "⟦サプライズ→サプライズ：10936_sapuraizu⟧⟦の→の：09472_no⟧⟦パーティー→パーティー：02946_paatii⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{計画|けいかく}していた→計画する：20998_keikakusuru⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧、⟦{本人|ほんにん}→本人：03627_honnin⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{感|かん}づかれないよう⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧⟦{気|き}をつけた→気をつける：09771_kiwotsukeru⟧。",
      "english": "We were planning a surprise party and were careful not to let her get wind of it.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    }
  ],
  "notes": "Usually about something someone is trying to hide, so it often appears in the passive ({感|かん}づかれる, to be found out) or with ⟦ない→ない：01118_nai⟧よう⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Intransitive in form; the thing sensed takes ⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧ (X ⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{感|かん}づく), sometimes ⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {気|き}づく / ⟦{気付|きづ}く→気付く：01933_kizuku⟧: to notice; neutral, anything at all\n- ⟦{察|さっ}する→察する：08053_sassuru⟧: to infer someone's feelings or situation; more formal and sympathetic",
